iate if my  father Herschel Walker stopped lying and  making a mockery of us  Walker's opponent Senator Rafael Warnock  hasn't weighed in on this controversy  yet but in a sign of how competitive  this race is new fundraising numbers  show that he raised more than 26 million  dollars in the last three months  Walker's Camp has yet to report its  latest numbers Tony  Nicole thank you very much
 

